# AI Workflow V2: Implementation Process

This document defines the implementation process for the AI Workflow Framework. It establishes the core phases, verification points, and human checkpoints throughout the implementation lifecycle.

## Phase 0: Task Initiation & Contextualization

**Purpose:** Assess the incoming request/plan and establish the necessary execution context and path.

**Inputs:** User request (simple task, feature implementation, refactoring request, etc.) OR an existing external plan documentuest Type:**
